1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,270
You're a courier. It's your last delivery.
And the apartment door just locked behind you.

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,047
In a post-Soviet communal flat.

3
00:00:10,297 --> 00:00:17,108
KOMMUNALKA. You have a flashlight, the residents have stories,
and you have to decide who is lying to you.

4
00:00:17,358 --> 00:00:21,661
It's point and click, which in horror means you can't run.
You just pick where to look.

5
00:00:21,911 --> 00:00:25,875
The demo is in English and Russian,
and all five of its reviews are positive.

6
00:00:26,275 --> 00:00:29,325
Worth a dip if you like
your horror slow and dark.

7
00:00:29,725 --> 00:00:33,375
That's Demo Dip.
A new Steam demo, every day.
